@BackendBalatro_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

### 1. Check Server Status
GET {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/status
Accept: application/json

### 2. Start Game
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/game/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Aji",
  "sessionId": "demo-session"
}

### 3. Get Game State
GET {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/game/state
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Available Blinds
GET {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/game/blinds
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Accept: application/json

### 5. Select Small Blind (Id: 1)
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/game/blinds/select
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blindId": 1
}

### 6. Score Preview
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/action/score-preview
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardIds": []
}

### 7. Play Hand
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/action/play-hand
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardIds": []
}

### 8. Discard Cards
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/action/discard
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardIds": []
}

### 9. View Shop (When in InShop Phase)
GET {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/shop
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Accept: application/json

### 10. Reroll Shop
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/shop/reroll
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Leave Shop
POST {{BackendBalatro_HostAddress}}/api/shop/leave
X-Session-Id: demo-session
Content-Type: application/json
